{
  "probe": "linked-files",
  "description": "Alice makes a source project and a target project (Bob editor, Carol reviewer, Dave viewer on the target, added in the container) and links sample.bib from the source into the target (provider project_file), then a compiled output.log (provider project_output_file) and a URL (provider url, not enabled on this harness). Bob watches the target. She edits the source and refreshes the link; refreshes of an unknown id, an ordinary file, by each role; the join's linkedFileData. Both projects are deleted.",
